1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 7]

34
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:45,070
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

35
00:01:46,290 --> 00:01:51,300
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

36
00:01:51,620 --> 00:01:59,650
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

37
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:08,540
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

38
00:02:08,540 --> 00:02:17,210
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

39
00:02:17,590 --> 00:02:26,460
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

40
00:02:26,890 --> 00:02:35,380
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪

41
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:44,400
Chang'an.

42
00:02:45,710 --> 00:02:47,040
Did you hear anything strange?

43
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,310
No.

44
00:02:48,630 --> 00:02:50,000
I only hear you talking.

45
00:02:50,310 --> 00:02:50,940
Listen closely.

46
00:02:51,510 --> 00:02:52,050
Carefully.

47
00:02:53,310 --> 00:02:55,030
It seems from Lord Pei's room.

48
00:02:55,580 --> 00:02:56,440
An assassin?

49
00:02:58,870 --> 00:03:00,910
Can't you tell that's Madam Xu?

50
00:03:01,150 --> 00:03:02,000
Impossible.

51
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,520
She'd never assassinate him.

52
00:03:04,220 --> 00:03:05,280
You idoit.

53
00:03:06,630 --> 00:03:07,400
What do you mean?

54
00:03:09,460 --> 00:03:10,080
Let's go.

55
00:03:20,810 --> 00:03:22,690
Lord Pei should be fine.

56
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,900
After a night's sleep,
he should recover.

57
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:27,730
That's good.

58
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,060
It's just

59
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,590
the Gu in his body...

60
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:31,580
Remember.

61
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:32,910
It's not Gu.

62
00:03:34,010 --> 00:03:35,080
His old wound flared up.

63
00:03:35,380 --> 00:03:35,960
Understood.

64
00:03:37,670 --> 00:03:38,400
Thank you, physician.

65
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,530
Guard Lu,

66
00:03:47,110 --> 00:03:48,310
what caused

67
00:03:49,370 --> 00:03:50,480
the wound on his shoulder?

68
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:55,630
When he was young,

69
00:03:55,850 --> 00:03:56,950
he worked at the Blood Jade Mine.

70
00:03:57,870 --> 00:03:59,140
The garrison there

71
00:03:59,570 --> 00:04:00,790
used all kinds of punishments.

72
00:04:01,870 --> 00:04:03,450
Perhaps some torture device
left that scar.

73
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:05,880
He worked at the mine too?

74
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:07,370
Madam Xu,

75
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,560
I'll leave him in your care.

76
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:11,630
Removing the Gu is our priority.

77
00:04:12,190 --> 00:04:13,240
I must leave for Nanshan

78
00:04:13,370 --> 00:04:14,680
to find the Gu master.

79
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:15,670
You can trust me on that.

80
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,600
Safe travels.

81
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:17,600
One more thing,

82
00:04:18,270 --> 00:04:18,950
Madam Xu.

83
00:04:19,950 --> 00:04:22,260
What I said to you before

84
00:04:22,690 --> 00:04:23,510
was out of line.

85
00:04:23,510 --> 00:04:24,430
Lord Lu,

86
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,010
may I ask you something?

87
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:28,320
What does Lord Pei like to eat?

88
00:04:28,550 --> 00:04:29,000
Is there anything...

89
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:29,720
Madam Xu,

90
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:31,630
Lord Pei is favored by the Emperor.

91
00:04:32,190 --> 00:04:33,680
His Majesty will decree who he marries.

92
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,240
His bride will be of Phoenix blood,

93
00:04:36,580 --> 00:04:37,460
or of noble Qingluan descent.

94
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:40,510
Do not waste your efforts.

95
00:04:42,750 --> 00:04:45,070
I mean no offense.

96
00:04:45,190 --> 00:04:47,000
I truly speak for your sake.

97
00:04:48,510 --> 00:04:49,310
Right now,

98
00:04:50,210 --> 00:04:51,510
Lord Pei is surrounded by danger.

99
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:53,500
And you

100
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:55,070
are a defenseless woman.

101
00:04:56,870 --> 00:04:58,880
I'm afraid

102
00:04:59,180 --> 00:05:00,310
you'll get caught up in it.

103
00:05:00,750 --> 00:05:01,770
Don't worry, Guard Lu.

104
00:05:02,210 --> 00:05:02,980
I understand.

105
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,740
You're only looking out for him.

106
00:05:06,110 --> 00:05:07,620
I'll take good care of him.

107
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:11,420
Take care.

108
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:28,160
Look at my blade.

109
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:28,920
Pretty nice.

110
00:05:30,870 --> 00:05:32,630
I knew Zheng wasn't cooking today.

111
00:05:32,630 --> 00:05:33,630
Finally, no buns and pickles.

112
00:05:33,630 --> 00:05:34,360
Madam Xu.

113
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:35,900
You're back.

114
00:05:36,940 --> 00:05:37,660
Ours are over here.

115
00:05:38,270 --> 00:05:39,390
I'm not eating buns.

116
00:05:40,310 --> 00:05:41,630
Madam Xu made soup.

117
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:42,750
There must be some for me.

118
00:05:42,750 --> 00:05:44,120
It's tonic food for Lord Pei.

119
00:05:44,750 --> 00:05:45,750
He's strong enough.

120
00:05:45,750 --> 00:05:46,430
He doesn't need it.

121
00:05:46,430 --> 00:05:47,270
I'm still growing.

122
00:05:47,270 --> 00:05:48,240
Let me have some.

123
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,780
Then I'll

124
00:05:49,790 --> 00:05:50,510
save a few bowls for you.

125
00:05:50,510 --> 00:05:51,190
Great.

126
00:05:51,870 --> 00:05:52,950
You're tall enough already.

127
00:05:52,950 --> 00:05:53,680
Get up.

128
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,270
- Sir.
- Sir.

129
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:02,560
Sir.

130
00:06:03,490 --> 00:06:04,300
Get back to work.

131
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,090
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

132
00:06:15,870 --> 00:06:16,820
Lu Li has already

133
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,020
left for Nanshan.

134
00:06:19,950 --> 00:06:20,950
Once the Gu is removed,

135
00:06:22,190 --> 00:06:23,240
I'll give you money for the journey.

136
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:25,530
Then you can leave.

137
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,360
No way I'm leaving.

138
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,630
I'll stay just to annoy you.

139
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:55,800
Jiannan Circuit offers only
ten casks of tribute wine yearly.

140
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,830
Without the Emperor's favor,

141
00:06:58,240 --> 00:07:01,000
whether you're royalty

142
00:07:01,220 --> 00:07:03,190
or a decorated general,

143
00:07:03,870 --> 00:07:06,830
no fortune could ever buy this cup.

144
00:07:07,060 --> 00:07:08,880
Thanks to Young Master Yun...

145
00:07:09,750 --> 00:07:10,100
No.

146
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,680
General Yun now.

147
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,430
Thanks to General Yun,

148
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:16,630
we get to taste this fine wine today.

149
00:07:17,030 --> 00:07:18,640
We're truly fortunate.

150
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:19,700
Come.

151
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:21,070
Let's all

152
00:07:21,170 --> 00:07:22,820
raise a cup to General Yun.

153
00:07:23,100 --> 00:07:24,680
May your future be bright.

154
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:27,070
Do look after us hereafter.

155
00:07:27,070 --> 00:07:28,160
We're all friends here.

156
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:28,980
No need for ceremony.

157
00:07:29,170 --> 00:07:29,650
Drink up.

158
00:07:31,830 --> 00:07:33,510
The Crown Prince arrives.

159
00:07:38,630 --> 00:07:39,220
At ease.

160
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,100
Your Highness, please sit above.

161
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,070
I was passing by.

162
00:07:46,070 --> 00:07:47,750
I saw your men outside.

163
00:07:47,750 --> 00:07:48,480
So I guessed

164
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,750
you were gathered here.

165
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,720
I came uninvited.

166
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:52,680
No need to stand on ceremony.

167
00:07:52,850 --> 00:07:53,510
Drink as you please.

168
00:07:55,190 --> 00:07:56,310
- Thank you, Your Highness.
- Thank you, Your Highness.

169
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:02,270
Come on.

170
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:11,120
Brother,

171
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,340
did you send the invitation?

172
00:08:12,830 --> 00:08:14,070
Why isn't Zhao here yet?

173
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:16,000
Better if he doesn't come.

174
00:08:16,270 --> 00:08:16,770
If it weren't for you,

175
00:08:16,770 --> 00:08:17,600
I wouldn't have invited him.

176
00:08:20,310 --> 00:08:22,680
The Noble Consort thinks highly of him.

177
00:08:23,270 --> 00:08:24,600
He may be your future brother-in-law.

178
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:27,750
You should keep him close.

179
00:08:29,230 --> 00:08:30,060
Don't mention him.

180
00:08:30,270 --> 00:08:31,170
It ruins the mood.

181
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,480
What?

182
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,230
Pei Zhao is coming too?

183
00:08:36,150 --> 00:08:37,600
Your Highness,

184
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:38,960
we sent him an invitation.

185
00:08:39,270 --> 00:08:40,080
But

186
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,600
he rarely attends banquets.

187
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:43,720
He probably

188
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,840
won't come.

189
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:45,370
Doesn't matter.

190
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:47,320
I'll have him come.

191
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:54,440
Thank you, Your Highness.

192
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,390
Sir,

193
00:08:58,630 --> 00:08:59,750
the Crown Prince sent someone

194
00:08:59,750 --> 00:09:00,670
to ask you to come over.

195
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,270
All right.

196
00:09:07,170 --> 00:09:08,170
Copy these case files

197
00:09:08,660 --> 00:09:09,390
all out neatly.

198
00:09:09,810 --> 00:09:11,030
But I hate writing.

199
00:09:12,750 --> 00:09:13,460
Then I'll do it.

200
00:09:13,910 --> 00:09:14,600
You go.

201
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:17,680
Why not let Madam Xu do it?

202
00:09:17,690 --> 00:09:18,720
Her handwriting is nice.

203
00:09:19,110 --> 00:09:19,550
No.

204
00:09:20,290 --> 00:09:21,470
She's going with me.

205
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:31,440
Sir.

206
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,290
I'll wait here.

207
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:41,120
Your Highness.

208
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:41,960
Lord Pei is here.

209
00:09:43,870 --> 00:09:45,290
Your Highness summoned me.

210
00:09:45,620 --> 00:09:46,630
May I ask for what matter?

211
00:09:48,410 --> 00:09:49,430
Chen Daohua is dead.

212
00:09:49,730 --> 00:09:50,630
There are many things

213
00:09:50,630 --> 00:09:51,510
I still don't understand.

214
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:52,900
So I called you here to ask.

215
00:09:54,670 --> 00:09:55,870
The case has been transcribed.

216
00:09:56,310 --> 00:09:56,830
It will be delivered

217
00:09:57,050 --> 00:09:57,990
to the Eastern Palace today.

218
00:10:00,510 --> 00:10:01,390
Lord Pei,

219
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,290
I want to hear it from you.

220
00:10:05,750 --> 00:10:06,610
All of you, leave.

221
00:10:11,550 --> 00:10:12,240
Brother.

222
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,600
Careful.

223
00:10:19,270 --> 00:10:19,960
Brother.

224
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,030
Take it easy.

225
00:10:21,030 --> 00:10:22,360
I'm fine.

226
00:10:22,430 --> 00:10:22,850
Yun Heng.

227
00:10:22,860 --> 00:10:23,850
Listen to me.

228
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,610
You're beautiful,

229
00:10:25,610 --> 00:10:26,570
gentle and graceful,

230
00:10:26,580 --> 00:10:27,570
and the finest musician in the capital.

231
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,600
That scum doesn't deserve you.

232
00:10:30,170 --> 00:10:31,670
I'll find you someone better.

233
00:10:32,470 --> 00:10:33,550
Brother, you're drunk.

234
00:10:46,300 --> 00:10:47,240
We're all siblings.

235
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:50,240
Why do you two get to love each other

236
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:52,120
while I'm the one being sacrificed?

237
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:55,550
Your Highness.

238
00:10:56,030 --> 00:10:57,640
Let's keep drinking.

239
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,200
Drink.

240
00:11:13,630 --> 00:11:15,150
Smells good.

241
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,120
Yun Shao?

242
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,110
Yun Shao.

243
00:11:29,790 --> 00:11:31,610
Yun Shao.

244
00:11:35,630 --> 00:11:36,750
Why did you try to kill me?

245
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:40,390
Your blood is of pure yin.

246
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:42,600
Sacrificing your blood

247
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:45,150
will keep our family prosperous forever.

248
00:11:45,150 --> 00:11:46,510
I'm your sister.

249
00:11:47,150 --> 00:11:48,400
I'm a daughter of the Yun family.

250
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,080
Sister?

251
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:52,240
You were only taken in.

252
00:11:52,790 --> 00:11:55,290
You're not our parents' real daughter.

253
00:11:55,310 --> 00:11:56,880
Being sacrificed

254
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:58,360
is your blessing.

255
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,510
Then just kill me.

256
00:12:00,290 --> 00:12:01,580
Why did you kill Yun Xiang?

257
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,880
Yun Xiang?

258
00:12:04,850 --> 00:12:07,710
That lowly maid deserved to die.

259
00:12:08,010 --> 00:12:09,840
She heard something she shouldn't have.

260
00:12:10,630 --> 00:12:11,680
You're the one who deserves to die.

261
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:13,870
Yun Xiang signed only ten years.

262
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,550
She could go home this year.

263
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,200
She helped you escape.

264
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:18,000
She deserved to die.

265
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:18,630
Go to hell.

266
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,080
Who are you talking to?

267
00:12:21,150 --> 00:12:22,320
Heng.

268
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:23,790
Heng.

269
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:26,280
Come with me.

270
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:28,080
Let go.

271
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:30,630
Why did you stop me?

272
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,200
Are you afraid of the Yun family?

273
00:12:32,870 --> 00:12:34,390
Yun Qi is only a weapon.

274
00:12:34,390 --> 00:12:35,270
If you kill him,

275
00:12:35,270 --> 00:12:36,870
you'll never
learn the truth you're after.

276
00:12:36,870 --> 00:12:37,960
Younger Lady Yun.

277
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,200
You heard everything?

278
00:12:42,030 --> 00:12:42,630
Brother.

279
00:12:42,790 --> 00:12:43,600
Heng.

280
00:12:53,870 --> 00:12:54,750
Is the physician here?

281
00:12:54,750 --> 00:12:55,240
Inside.

282
00:12:59,000 --> 00:12:59,790
Sir.

283
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:07,840
Did you confirm

284
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:08,630
what we discussed last time?

285
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:10,840
People's blood does differ.

286
00:13:10,990 --> 00:13:11,960
Yin and yang applied

287
00:13:12,110 --> 00:13:14,510
to blood rituals

288
00:13:14,510 --> 00:13:16,000
gave rise to pure-yin

289
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,480
and pure-yang constitutions.

290
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:18,870
They say

291
00:13:18,870 --> 00:13:20,670
the purer the bloodline,

292
00:13:20,870 --> 00:13:22,310
the stronger the ritual.

293
00:13:22,870 --> 00:13:24,200
The blood sacrifice

294
00:13:24,380 --> 00:13:25,600
can make a family prosper?

295
00:13:25,930 --> 00:13:27,760
It's nothing but greed.

296
00:13:27,990 --> 00:13:29,960
Someone's using that dark art?

297
00:13:30,180 --> 00:13:30,790
Wasn't it banned

298
00:13:30,790 --> 00:13:32,630
by the court long ago?

299
00:13:32,860 --> 00:13:34,870
Anyone who uses it

300
00:13:35,270 --> 00:13:36,750
will be executed.

301
00:13:36,750 --> 00:13:38,320
If anyone asks about this,

302
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:39,670
you know what to say.

303
00:13:40,050 --> 00:13:40,630
I do.

304
00:13:42,100 --> 00:13:43,300
You were never here.

305
00:13:46,670 --> 00:13:48,200
The Yuns already thrive.

306
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:50,910
Why are they still not content?

307
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:54,080
They'd offer their own daughter.

308
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:59,270
I'm helping you complete the rite.

309
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:00,670
This is your duty

310
00:14:00,670 --> 00:14:01,910
and your honor.

311
00:14:05,910 --> 00:14:08,240
Greed is like an abyss.

312
00:14:08,790 --> 00:14:09,790
It can never be filled.

313
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,630
For eighteen years,

314
00:14:16,670 --> 00:14:18,720
they kept me in the mansion

315
00:14:19,030 --> 00:14:20,200
like a caged bird.

316
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:21,510
I could not step outside.

317
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,750
I ate only greens and water.

318
00:14:26,390 --> 00:14:28,030
It wasn't until Yun Xiang came
into my life

319
00:14:28,910 --> 00:14:29,510
that I learned

320
00:14:29,510 --> 00:14:31,440
there was more than plain food.

321
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:33,790
So many delicacies.

322
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,600
So many wonderful things.

323
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:39,070
I learned that women
could drink and eat meat,

324
00:14:39,510 --> 00:14:40,680
run and laugh.

325
00:14:42,150 --> 00:14:43,510
Yun Xiang was all I had.

326
00:14:45,910 --> 00:14:47,320
But they killed her.

327
00:14:51,750 --> 00:14:53,120
Sacrificing their daughter

328
00:14:53,750 --> 00:14:54,870
and killing the innocent.

329
00:14:55,870 --> 00:14:56,790
They won't get away with this.

330
00:14:58,240 --> 00:14:59,360
The Fengyi Bureau

331
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,600
will uncover the truth

332
00:15:01,150 --> 00:15:02,150
and get justice for you.

333
00:15:02,870 --> 00:15:03,390
Sir,

334
00:15:04,550 --> 00:15:05,960
I want to enter the selection.

335
00:15:06,630 --> 00:15:07,790
I want to become a Fengyi Guard

336
00:15:08,510 --> 00:15:10,150
and get justice

337
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:11,910
for Yun Xiang and myself.

338
00:15:19,510 --> 00:15:20,670
That Pei Zhao.

339
00:15:21,150 --> 00:15:22,840
Does he think I can't touch him?

340
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:25,120
He dodges every question.

341
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:27,030
He shows me no respect at all.

342
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:29,480
Noble Consort values him highly.

343
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:31,670
When Your Highness takes the throne,

344
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,390
you'll need a blade like him.

345
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:35,600
Please be patient for now.

346
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,720
Once you take the throne,

347
00:15:38,390 --> 00:15:39,840
it won't be too late to deal with him.

348
00:15:44,390 --> 00:15:45,200
Sir,

349
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:46,550
I can copy the case files.

350
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:48,750
Didn't Lord Lu always do that?

351
00:15:49,270 --> 00:15:50,270
He's not here now.

352
00:15:50,870 --> 00:15:52,080
If you trust me,

353
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:53,870
let me do it.

354
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:56,550
Lu can do his own work

355
00:15:56,870 --> 00:15:58,870
when he gets back.

356
00:16:00,910 --> 00:16:03,030
How many files will pile up by then?

357
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:06,510
Here.

358
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,360
Grind the ink.

359
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:10,840
Yes.

360
00:16:18,790 --> 00:16:19,550
You're good at this.

361
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,270
Did you write often at home?

362
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:22,320
Yes.

363
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:27,870
Sir,

364
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:29,910
I used to read stories

365
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:32,390
about how prosperous the capital was,

366
00:16:32,390 --> 00:16:33,320
with doors left unlocked at night.

367
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,600
Those are just stories.

368
00:16:35,870 --> 00:16:38,600
The capital has four quarters.

369
00:16:38,910 --> 00:16:41,030
South ranks first, then north.

370
00:16:41,630 --> 00:16:43,440
As for these corners in the west,

371
00:16:43,630 --> 00:16:45,440
they're where the Wingless live.

372
00:16:45,790 --> 00:16:47,390
They can't enter the south.

373
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,870
If they do, they die.

374
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,390
The Wingless again.

375
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:57,480
If you want to stay,

376
00:16:57,910 --> 00:16:59,720
lose that sympathy of yours.

377
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:08,830
I am Zhang Fei.

378
00:17:08,830 --> 00:17:10,070
Courtesy name Yide.

379
00:17:10,070 --> 00:17:12,790
You stole dozens of sacks of pork.

380
00:17:13,310 --> 00:17:14,030
Today,

381
00:17:14,030 --> 00:17:16,240
I've come to settle the score.

382
00:17:18,890 --> 00:17:20,500
Sir, why are we here?

383
00:17:22,030 --> 00:17:23,960
Don't you want to enter the selection?

384
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:25,200
Look at these people.

385
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:26,400
Which of them could enter?

386
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:29,480
You mean

387
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:32,480
commoners can't join the Fengyi Bureau?

388
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:34,920
Everyone who enters Fengyi Bureau

389
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:37,750
has their birth, family, and clan

390
00:17:37,750 --> 00:17:39,110
and everyone around them

391
00:17:39,110 --> 00:17:40,400
thoroughly investigated.

392
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,830
Only after passing that test

393
00:17:42,830 --> 00:17:44,070
can you truly forget

394
00:17:44,070 --> 00:17:45,920
your old name and identity.

395
00:17:46,510 --> 00:17:47,640
From then on, your life

396
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:49,680
may be like these shadow puppets,

397
00:17:49,830 --> 00:17:51,680
forever playing someone else.

398
00:17:53,350 --> 00:17:54,270
I'm willing.

399
00:17:55,350 --> 00:17:56,350
I don't want to be

400
00:17:56,350 --> 00:17:58,070
that fool trapped in the courtyard,

401
00:17:58,750 --> 00:18:00,550
living on plain food and water,

402
00:18:01,070 --> 00:18:04,000
never meeting anyone
or knowing how people really are.

403
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:08,200
You're really not afraid?

404
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,200
No.

405
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:15,160
Sir.

406
00:18:15,300 --> 00:18:16,370
It's the Girls' Festival today.

407
00:18:16,500 --> 00:18:17,960
Buy your lady a sachet.

408
00:18:18,310 --> 00:18:19,030
I am not...

409
00:18:19,270 --> 00:18:19,810
We'll take them.

410
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:20,790
Take one each.

411
00:18:21,180 --> 00:18:21,540
All right.

412
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,200
Thank you.

413
00:18:30,790 --> 00:18:31,720
It smells of human blood.

414
00:18:55,380 --> 00:18:58,190
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

415
00:18:59,810 --> 00:19:03,000
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

416
00:19:04,320 --> 00:19:06,060
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

417
00:19:06,560 --> 00:19:11,000
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

418
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:15,830
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

419
00:19:17,050 --> 00:19:22,060
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

420
00:19:22,380 --> 00:19:30,410
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

421
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:39,300
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

422
00:19:39,300 --> 00:19:47,970
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

423
00:19:48,350 --> 00:19:57,220
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

424
00:19:57,650 --> 00:20:06,140
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
